{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"cash","type":"text","text":"## 哈夫币存量\n含可用、冻结与待领取\n[[03-宏观循环-哈夫币的流动与组成]]","x":0,"y":0,"width":400,"height":200},
		{"id":"cash-in","type":"text","text":"## 现金新增\n系统现金奖励\n系统收购物资支付\n不含玩家间成交回款","x":-500,"y":-200,"width":360,"height":190},
		{"id":"cash-out","type":"text","text":"## 现金回收\n不可退交易费用\n向系统支付的现金\n不含可退保证金","x":500,"y":-200,"width":360,"height":190},
		{"id":"freeze","type":"text","text":"## 状态与归属\n可用／冻结／待领取之间转换\nP2P货款在玩家之间转移\n只因明确费用减少总量","x":0,"y":300,"width":400,"height":200},
		{"id":"goods","type":"text","text":"## 局外物资\n带入／带出：位置转移\n玩家成交：归属转移\n系统产出、使用与回收另记","x":-500,"y":300,"width":400,"height":220},
		{"id":"progress","type":"text","text":"## 不可逆养成进度\n提交现金和材料换功能\n不把历史投入加回可支配财富\n可能增加后续生产供给","x":500,"y":300,"width":400,"height":220}
	],
	"edges":[
		{"id":"in-cash","fromNode":"cash-in","fromSide":"right","toNode":"cash","toSide":"left","label":"现金新增"},
		{"id":"cash-out","fromNode":"cash","fromSide":"right","toNode":"cash-out","toSide":"left","label":"现金回收"},
		{"id":"cash-freeze","fromNode":"cash","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"freeze","toSide":"top","label":"状态转换"},
		{"id":"freeze-cash","fromNode":"freeze","fromSide":"top","toNode":"cash","toSide":"bottom","label":"解冻／领取，总量不变"},
		{"id":"cash-progress","fromNode":"cash","fromSide":"right","toNode":"progress","toSide":"left","label":"升级现金"},
		{"id":"goods-progress","fromNode":"goods","fromSide":"right","toNode":"progress","toSide":"left","label":"升级材料"},
		{"id":"progress-goods","fromNode":"progress","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"goods","toSide":"bottom","label":"若解锁生产则可能新增"}
